    <p class="dek">Did your color grade look flawless across your editing monitor, only to appear washed out, crushed, or blurry the instant you uploaded to social media? The underlying fault rarely lies within your grade—it stems from Delivery page export parameters mismatching online platform compression algorithms.</p>
